<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">EVERY MISTAKE MATTERS</view><view class="heading">收录一道错题</view><view class="subtitle">记录问题，就是理解它的第一步。</view><view class="tip">整页作业、没有标准答案？<button class="primary small" bindtap="reviewPage">整页识别 · 辅助判题 →</button></view><view class="photo-panel"><view class="panel-title">拍一下，把错题留下来</view><view class="panel-note">题目图片会交给已配置的第三方视觉模型识别；请校对识别结果，再补充正确答案。</view><view class="photo-actions"><button class="primary" data-source="camera" bindtap="choosePhoto" disabled="{{busy || uploading || recognizing}}">◎ 拍照录入</button><button class="secondary" data-source="album" bindtap="choosePhoto" disabled="{{busy || uploading || recognizing}}">▧ 相册选图</button></view><block wx:if="{{imagePath}}"><image class="photo-preview" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="previewPhoto"/><view class="row"><text class="photo-status">{{photoNote}}</text></view><view class="photo-actions"><button class="secondary small" bindtap="processPhoto" loading="{{uploading || recognizing}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading || recognizing}}">{{imageId ? '重新识别' : '重试上传并识别'}}</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="removePhoto" disabled="{{busy || uploading || recognizing}}">移除图片</button></view></block><view class="photo-tip">支持 JPG、PNG、WebP，单张不超过 8 MB；原图将随错题保存。</view></view><view class="form-columns"><view><view class="label">学科</view><picker range="{{subjects}}" value="{{subjectIndex}}" data-field="subjectIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="form-picker">{{subjects[subjectIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">难度</view><picker range="{{difficulties}}" value="{{difficultyIndex}}" data-field="difficultyIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="form-picker">{{difficulties[difficultyIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="form-columns"><view><view class="label">年级</view><picker range="{{grades}}" value="{{gradeIndex}}" data-field="gradeIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="form-picker">{{grades[gradeIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">题型</view><picker range="{{questionTypes}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" data-field="typeIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="form-picker">{{questionTypes[typeIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="label">自定义分类（选填，填写后优先使用）</view><input class="input" data-field="customGrade" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="其他年级 / 学段"/><input class="input" data-field="customSubject" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="其他学科 / 专业课程"/><input class="input" data-field="customType" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="其他题型"/><view class="label">题目标题 *</view><input class="input" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如：二次函数的顶点与最值" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="label">题目内容 *</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="input" maxlength="10000" placeholder="输入完整题干，选择题请写出选项…" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="label">正确答案 *</view><input class="input" value="{{answer}}" data-field="answer" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" placeholder="填写正确答案" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="label">思路与解析（选填）</view><textarea class="textarea short" value="{{explanation}}" data-field="explanation" bindinput="input" maxlength="10000" placeholder="写下解题思路，帮未来的自己少走弯路" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="label">知识点（选填）</view><input class="input" value="{{topic}}" data-field="topic" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如：二次函数" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="label">出错原因</view><picker range="{{reasons}}" value="{{reasonIndex}}" data-field="reasonIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="form-picker">{{reasons[reasonIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading || recognizing}}">＋ 保存到错题本</button></view>
